'''Ditto Skin''' is an {{Epic}} Cosmetic that can copy another player's skin and spawn an {{Item|Island NPC}} with the captured skin. 

== Obtaining ==
A '''Ditto Skin''' can be purchased from the {{BingoText|shop}} for {{Bingo Points|100}}, once the player has achieved {{BingoText|3}}.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|rarity = epic
|type = Cosmetic
|item_ability_name = Copycat
|item_ability_description = Copies the skin of an unsuspecting player.
|item_ability_cooldown = 10s
}}
Hold this item and right-click on a player to copy their skin. It can be used multiple times. 

Once used, the item becomes {{Soulbound|Co-op}} to prevent abuse. 

After capturing a skin, it can be placed on a player's [[Private Island]] to spawn an NPC with the captured skin. 

== Trivia ==
* The name "Ditto" probably originates from the Pokémon of the same name, which is known for its ability to transform.
** The simplistic face and color also somewhat resembles Ditto.

